<title>USA: FGIC qualifies six muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies six muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said it has qualified for bond insurance six municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Matteson, Ill., $5.3 million of general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Grand Prairie, Texas, $3.2 million of certificates of obligation.</p>
<p>--Grand Prairie, Texas, $2.4 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Kenosha County, Wis., $3.9 million of GO promissory notes.</p>
<p>--Kenosha County, Wis., $29 million of GO detention center notes.</p>
<p>--St. Martinville, La., $1.2 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
